      "message": "I think the core variant of libc here should be (`libc`, `android_arm64_armv8-ahared`). This is the source `libc` that _can_ be present in the importing inner tree if the importing inner tree is building both system and apexes. This comes from the requirement that any combination of (system|apex|vendor) _can_ be buildable in a single inner tree, and configured by the .mcombo file\n\nIf we make `libfoo`\u0027s core variant link against `libc.apiimport`\u0027s core variant, it will mean that it is linking core variant of _stubs_. `libfoo`\u0027s core variant should be linking against core variant of _source_ instead",
